    <item>
      <title>AI“入侵”课堂，教授们竟然集体“真香”了？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/article-20251125221008279-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 25 Nov 2025 22:10:08 +0800</pubDate>
